      "content": "That's a good point. I'm especially worried about the complexity of the mutual fund side—sometimes it feels like costs just creep up or appear out of nowhere due to poor management or inefficiency. Can you touch on how those inefficiencies or \"glitches\" in fund management usually manifest for the end investor?",
